<title>UK: BAA 9-mth pretax profit rises 6.2 pct.</title>
<headline>BAA 9-mth pretax profit rises 6.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		28.9		   vs 27.4</p>
<p> Passengers (million)   76.6		   vs 73.4</p>
<p> Revenue		    1,064		  vs 987</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    397		    vs 374</p>
<p> Operating profit	 425		    VS 390</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British airports operator is BAA Plc. Analysts had forecast third-quarter pre-tax profits between 392 million and 400 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
